\ Phase 4 Slice 6e dogfood: `if` in a polymorphic body. `mymax`/`choose` each
\ branch once; `mymax3` nests an `if` inside an `if` arm, checking D4's claim
\ that nested `if` falls out of the recursive poly-walk rather than needing a
\ dedicated mechanism.

import: intrinsics * ;
import: hosted::show | . | ;
import: core::prelude * ;    \ Bool comes through here, the prelude's own re-export.

\ P7.S3o (R6): `mymax` and `mymax3` restored to `inline` with `'T: Copy Ord`.
\ The per-splice instantiation mechanism (Phase 1) mints a `CallInst` per inner
\ `gt` call at each splice site, so each concrete type dispatches to the
\ correct `impl: Ord` monomorph. `choose` stays `inline` (it carries no
\ bound).
: mymax inline ['T: Copy Ord] ( 'T 'T -- 'T ) over over gt ~[ drop ] ~[ swap drop ] if ;

: choose inline ( 'T 'T Bool -- 'T ) | a b flag | flag ~[ a b drop ] ~[ b a drop ] if ;

: mymax3 inline ['T: Copy Ord] ( 'T 'T 'T -- 'T )
  | a b c |
  a b gt ~[
    a c gt ~[ a ] ~[ c ] if
  ] ~[
    b c gt ~[ b ] ~[ c ] if
  ] if ;

: main ( -- )
  2 5 9 mymax3 .
  2.0 5.0 9.0 mymax3 . ;
